        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="Hn 90.11d" corresp="#wit-lat"><pb n="606" ed="#liebermann"/>In hiis et similibus ubi<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="33" target="#Hn_90-11d.lnote.oe.33"/> homo aliud intendit, et aliud euenit — ubi opus accusatur, non uoluntas —, uenialem<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="s" target="#Hn_90-11d.lnote.oe.s"/> pocius emendacionem<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="34" target="#Hn_90-11d.lnote.oe.34"/> et honorificenciam<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="t" target="#Hn_90-11d.lnote.oe.t"/> iudices<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="u" target="#Hn_90-11d.lnote.oe.u"/><ptr type="liebermannNote" n="35" target="#Hn_90-11d.lnote.oe.35"/> statuant, sicut acciderit.</ab>
